    "August 19, 2022 marked the first day of AniberSAYA sa Barangay IV held in Pandan, Angeles City and was spearheaded by your countryside radio, RW 95.1 FM, in celebration of our 27th anniversary. The fair’s next stop was at Brgy. Calibutbut, Bacolor, August 26; Brgy. Manibaug Libutad, Porac, September 2; Brgy. San Roque Dau 1st, Lubao, September 9; and, Brgy. Pandacaqui, Mexico; September 16.",
